Deposit_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller deposits with no fees configured
│  ├── it should mint shares
│  ├── it should relay 95% of assets to yoUSD address
│  └── it should keep 5% of assets in the vault
├── when caller deposits with deposit fee configured
│  ├── it should mint net shares (after fee)
│  ├── it should send fee to fee recipient
│  └── it should relay 95% of net (post-fee) assets to yoUSD
└── when caller deposits 0 wei
   └── it should not relay anything (relayAmount = 0)
